WEBVTT

00:11:58.839 --> 00:12:01.341
so are the ones who have lost their way.

00:12:04.428 --> 00:12:06.054
Take a moment with me.

00:12:06.805 --> 00:12:08.098
Fifteen seconds.

00:12:08.974 --> 00:12:10.642
And I'll keep the time.

00:12:12.936 --> 00:12:15.814
Think about the people who loved you
when you lost your way.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.194
Who huged you when you needed it.

00:12:22.446 --> 00:12:24.406
Who assumed best intention.

00:12:26.658 --> 00:12:28.452
Who validated you.

00:12:28.911 --> 00:12:31.997
And embraced you
even when you felt undeserving.